<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html; charset=utf-8' />
    <title>:: Thank You for Your Feedback! :: </title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style type='text/css'>
      body { background-color: #f9fafb; margin: 0; } .logo {width: 100px;}
    </style>
  </head>

  <body style='padding: 33px 0;'>
    <table
      width='576'
      border='0'
      align='center'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
    >
      <tr>
        <td bgcolor='#FFFFFF' style='padding: 23px'>
          <table
            width='100%'
            border='0'
            align='center'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
          >
            <tr>
              <td align='center'>
                <a href='{{clientUrl}}'><img
                    src='{{logoPath}}'
                    style='width: 100px;'
                    alt=''
                  /></a>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='55' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                align='center'
                style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px"
              >Thank You for Your Feedback!</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='25' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >Hi {{{body.name}}},</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='18' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >We appreciate you taking the time to share your feedback with us.
                Your insights are invaluable in helping us improve our services.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='26' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                valign='top'
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >Your concerns regarding
                <strong>{{{body.complaint}}}</strong>
                have been noted. Our team is currently reviewing the situation
                and will work diligently to address your feedback.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='22' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                valign='top'
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >Should you have any further questions or additional comments,
                please feel free to reach out. We are here to help!</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='18' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                valign='top'
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >Thank you for being a part of the Budget Base community.
                Together, we can make a difference!</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='22' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                valign='top'
                style="color: #344054; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px"
              >Best regards,<br />The Budget Base Team</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='32' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style='background-color: #EAECF0; height: 1px'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='32' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td height='13' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td
                style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #696969;"
              >© 2024 Base</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td height='10' style='font-size: 0;'></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>